{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t10月最後1個交易日，恒指重上23000點。指數高開後，最多升至23367點，升逾400點，半日收市報23335點，升377點，半日成交重上千億元，近1071億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數升1.4%，報3797點。ATXMJ升2%至近半成，美團表現較好。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n友邦季績後升近4%。內需股造好，蒙牛升逾7%，是表現最好恒指成份股。安踏、海爾智家、華潤啤酒升逾4%。資源、內銀股都上升。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n部分AI硬件股、晶片股向下。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T04:41:44.420360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T04:17:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T05:41:10.956586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:41.839957+00:00","content_hash":"a263812f53e6d2fb2fdfe7212e3069600e0cf9c6dedd1eccbeaf9e00daad4c34","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}